# AICL Example: Sum Divisors
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Proper divisors

Layer:
Core

Behavior Sum
    Input: n
    Output: total
    Action:
        total = 0
        i = 1
        while i * i <= n:
            if n % i == 0:
                total = total + i
                if i != n // i:
                    total = total + (n // i)
            i = i + 1
        return total - n
